  <data name="txtBasics.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome to Challenge 3; the final challenge! There are no prerequisite skills in this challenge.

This is a typical puzzle game; upon pressing "Start", a level with various obstacles will be loaded which you must traverse in order to reach the end.

Movement is achieved through the typical WASD keybinds.

Upon reaching the end, you will be awarded score depending on your time; 8 for a "golden" time, 5 for "silver", 2 for "bronze" and 1 for any other, so it truly is a race against time!

If you've trapped yourself in a level, press the "Reset" button to reset it to its original state. If it's too difficult, press the "Next level" button.


</value>
  </data>
